#: ../chapter02.rst:3
msgid "2 Installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:6
msgid "You can download and install the File Server Agent software directly from the Web Portal. Complete the following steps to install the |prodname| File Server Agent software on your file server."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:11
msgid "2.1 System Requirement"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:13
msgid "File Server Agent can be installed on the following OS"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:15
msgid "Server OS"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:17
msgid "Windows 2022"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:18
msgid "Windows 2019"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:19
msgid "Windows 2016"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:21
msgid "Client OS"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:23
msgid "Windows 10"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:24
msgid "Windows 8.1"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:25
msgid "Windows 8.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:26
msgid "Windows 7"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:27
msgid "Windows Vista"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:28
msgid "Windows XP"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:33
msgid "2.2 Preparation"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:35
msgid "File Server Agent depends on .NET framework 2.0 or later. If you are installing the file Server Agent on Windows Server 2022/2019/2016, you need to prepare the .NET environment. This usually can be done from the Windows Server Manager > Manage Roles and Features and then in the features section, select .NET Framework 3.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:40
msgid "WINDOWS SERVER 2016 .NET FRAMEWORK FEATURE"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:43
msgid "If you are installing File Server Agent on Windows 8/Windows 10, you can get .NET framework 2.0 (3.5) installed from \"Program Files\" -> Windows Components."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:48
msgid "WINDOWS 10 .NET FRAMEWORK 3.5 FEATURE"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:53
msgid "2.3 Install"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:57
msgid "Always install |prodname| File Server Agent as a Tenant Administrator when you are at the login dialog."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:59
msgid "File Server Agent belongs to a specific Tenant instead of belonging to a specific user. So it is best to download the File Server Agent as the Tenant Administrator and set it up to connect to the same Tenant Administrator's account."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:62
msgid "Step 1 - Download the Installer Package"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:64
msgid "From the File Server you wish to install the File Server Agent; open a browser and log in to the Web Portal as the Tenant Administrator. From the Management Console, click the **(+)** in the \"Remote Active Directory\" section on the right-hand side."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:69
msgid "SERVER AGENT DOWNLOADS ACCESS"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:71
msgid "In the pop-up window, choose your Download Package from the pull-down menu and click **Go** to begin the installation."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:73
msgid "A window will open. Click the MSI file at the bottom of the browser to open the installer."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:78
msgid "OPEN THE INSTALLER"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:82
msgid "File Server agent software is capable of synchronizing three things between the local file server and remote cloud storage account."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:84
msgid "synchronize selected files and folders."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:85
msgid "synchronize selected Active Directory users from local to cloud."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:86
msgid "synchronize NTFS permissions on the local file server to cloud."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:88
msgid "You can start installing file server agent from \"Adding Remote Active Directory\" or from \"Adding Team Folder via Remote Server Agent\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:91
msgid "Step 2 - Run the Installer Package"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:93
msgid "Click **\"Run\"** to start the installation."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:98
msgid "RUN THE SERVER AGENT INSTALLER"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:101
msgid "Step 3 - Welcome Screen"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:103
#: ../chapter02.rst:111
msgid "On the Welcome Screen choose **\"Next\"** to continue."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:108
msgid "WELCOME SCREEN"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:114
msgid "Step 4 - License Agreement"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:116
msgid "Read and accept the license agreement by choosing **\"I Agree\"** and click the **\"Next\"** button."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:121
msgid "ACCEPT LICENSE AGREEMENT"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:124
msgid "Step 5 - Confirm Installation"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:126
msgid "Now we will complete the File Server Agent installation. Click **\"Next\"** to finish."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:131
msgid "CONFIRM INSTALLATION"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:134
msgid "Step 6 - Installation is Finishing"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:136
msgid "It will only take a few minutes to complete the installation."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:141
msgid "FINAL INSTALLATION PROCESS"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:144
msgid "Step 7 - Installation Complete"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:146
msgid "Once the installation is completed, click the **\"Close\"** button to finish."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:151
msgid "CLOSE INSTALLATION WINDOW"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:154
msgid "Step 8 - Restart Your System"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:156
msgid "Just restart your system and File Server Agent is ready to use."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:161
msgid "RESTART YOUR SYSTEM"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:165
msgid "Step 9 - Login To |prodname|"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:167
msgid "After the reboot, log back into Windows as the same Windows user. Be patient, as it will take a few minutes for the Login Panel to display. Login to |prodname| as using your Tenant Administrator credentials."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:170
msgid "The File Server Agent can be logged in to the Tenant already if you don't see the login dialog. You can go to the Web Portal side, login as the Tenant Administrator and go to the \"Device Manager\" side to see the File Server Agent."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter02.rst:175
msgid "LOG IN AS TENANT ADMIN"
msgstr ""
